----INTRA-PROTEIN CONTACT MATRIX FOR MEMBRANE-BOUND with p62 LIR-----

This directory contains the raw matrices generated by fast_cont_mat.py in three folders.
    i) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM1_cont_mat (Replica 1)
    ii) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM2_cont_mat (Replica 2)
    iii) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM3_cont_mat (Replica 3)
The merged csv files are generated with cont_map_maker.py for each replicate
    i) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM1_cont_mat.csv (Replica 1)
    ii) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM2_cont_mat.csv (Replica 2)
    iii) LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_SIM3_cont_mat.csv (Replica 3)

Finally, the consensus contact matrix from three replicated generated using consensus_cont_mat_maker.py is saved as LC3B_P62_INCLUDED_consensus_cont_mat.csv